    LLM: 'Game: Žandari. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: 'Žandari (Pishpirik) is a Serbian/Balkan fishing card game. 2-4 players. 52-card deck. 4 face-up table + hand cards. Capture by matching rank or summing to played card value. Jack clears entire table. Score: most cards=2pts, most clubs=1pt, 2♣=1pt, 10♦=1pt. First to 11.',
    objective: 'Score points by capturing cards and bonuses (most cards 2 pts, most clubs 1 pt, 2♣ 1 pt, 10♦ 1 pt). The match is played until a player or team reaches the agreed target score (typically 11, 21 or other).',
